      "latest": "Janitor re-measurement (2026-07-31): STILL LIVE and WORSE. `Cohomology/RelCurveCollapse.lean` is now **779** lines (was 752 at filing, limit 500).\n\nWider context for whoever takes it: the house limit is exceeded by **27** files in AJCR, which the project README already states at that count. So the single-file ask here is one instance of a project-wide pattern; splitting only this file closes the item but not the constraint. No janitor action — a split is a Lean edit."
